  "$comment": [
    "TASK-1050 W1 (README §12) — the judge-model capability declaration `AiModel._metadata.judge`, the per-lane",
    "routing task keys and the TEXT judge-route request protocol.",
    "`valid` entries pass judgeMetadataProblems with no problem; each `invalid` entry yields a problem containing `problem`.",
    "`supports`: assertModelSupportsLane(meta, lane) passes for every lane in `supported`, and throws",
    "JUDGE_LANE_UNSUPPORTED for every lane in `unsupported`. Qwen3Guard native category names are PROPOSED and",
    "verified by Track S (S-2) before W4 seeds the row; the parser (W2a) treats them as config.",
    "TypeScript: packages/types/src/guardrail-judge-model.ts. Python mirror: apps/guardrail (W2a)."
